# 行尾策略：本仓库只在 Windows + .NET Framework 下构建，统一检出为 CRLF，
# 仓库内存 LF（避免同一文件在不同工具下反复显示为"已修改"）。
* text=auto eol=crlf

# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换，也不做文本 diff
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.tif   binary
*.tiff  binary
*.gif   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.pdb   binary
